Author: JASP Team
Website: jasp-stats.org
Maintainer: JASP Team <info@jasp-stats.org>
Description: Module that allows to perform causal inference methods, such as matching and weighting, based on propensitys scores metrics, like probability of treatment assignment or Mahalanobis distance.
